{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q1", "domain": "unknown", "question": "此命出生家境如何？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，年柱辛卯，月柱己亥，日主戊土生于亥月，不得令，但日支午火、时支巳火为印星生身，时干丁火正印透出，形成火土相生之势。年柱辛金伤官坐卯木正官，月柱己土劫财坐亥水偏财，整体来看，命主出生时家庭环境有一定根基，但并非大富大贵。年柱伤官配正官，暗示父辈可能有公职或管理性质的工作，但伤官透出也主变动或经商之象。月柱劫财坐偏财，说明家中可能有积蓄但非巨富，且母亲或长辈中有一定影响力（劫财在月柱，可能代表母亲或同辈中有能力者）。综合判断，命主家境中等偏上，父母中可能有一方有公职或管理背景，但并非显赫官员或巨富。选项中最符合的是“父从商母是村干部”，因为伤官主经商，月柱劫财坐偏财且亥中藏甲木七杀，可能对应母亲有基层管理角色。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q1", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3404, "response_id": "451d0a19-7e2b-4efb-a695-ef3b52513398", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 211, "completion_tokens": 252, "total_tokens": 463, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 83}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q2", "domain": "relationship", "question": "婚姻如何？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主戊土生于亥月，水旺土弱，但日支午火为印星生身，时柱丁巳火土相生，整体命局火土有根，不算太弱。女命以官杀为夫星，八字中月支亥水藏壬甲，年支卯木藏乙木，时支巳火藏丙戊庚，天干无明现官杀，但地支亥中壬水为偏财，卯中乙木为正官（夫星）藏于年支，且卯木被辛金克制，夫星受制。日支午火为夫宫，午火为印星，代表丈夫性格温和或依赖，但午火与月支亥水暗合（亥午暗合），有夫星被合走或感情复杂之象。时柱丁巳为印比，晚年有依靠，但夫星不显且受制，婚姻易有波折。综合来看，命主可能经历一次婚姻但关系不睦，或丈夫健康不佳，但未至早亡或二婚之象，更倾向一婚但婚姻质量一般。结合选项，最符合的是A。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19511114_P001-Q2", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3667, "response_id": "3c2eea67-b3e1-4127-b126-53e145778889", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 207, "completion_tokens": 260, "total_tokens": 467, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 79}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
