{"case_id": "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q8", "domain": "career", "question": "命主在2018年至现在，财政状态和事业运势怎样？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：乙木日主生于午月，火旺木焚，年柱丁卯、月柱丙午、时柱壬午，火势极旺，日主乙木虽有年支卯木、日支卯木为根，但火炎土燥，木气被泄耗严重。时干壬水为调候用神，但壬水坐午火被截脚，力量微弱，且被丁火合绊，用神受损。\n\n2018年戊戌，流年干支皆为土，土旺耗火生金，但原局无金，土重木折，且戊土正财合身，主财务压力大，但事业上戊土为财，可能因工作得财，但消耗也大。2019-2023年走庚戌、辛亥大运（若按周岁起运，约2017年后进入庚戌运），庚金正官透出，但庚金坐戌土燥土，金弱难制火，官星无力，事业上易有变动或压力；辛亥运中，辛金七杀被旺火克制，亥水为喜用，但亥卯未三合木局（原局有卯），木旺生火，反助火势，财运不稳。\n\n综合看，命主火旺无制，财星（土）被火生但又被木克，且用神壬水受制，主财来财去，积蓄困难。事业上，官杀弱而受制，易频繁变动或难以稳定升迁。结合选项，最符合“不停转工，财来财去，且依赖家人或伴侣支持”的描述。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q8", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4541, "response_id": "2f1c140e-9813-4613-8f69-9202a916fcff", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 276, "completion_tokens": 360, "total_tokens": 636, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 20}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
